==Evaluation==
; Pros
* [[Empathy]] is effective against attackers.
* Can interrupt spells and skills.
* Can cause knockdown with [[Psychic Instability]].
* Can remove [[hex]]es.
* Possesses a self-heal.

; Cons
* Henchmen do not use or prioritize interrupts effectively.

